# Line endings for files that run inside the Linux devcontainer.
#
# A Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks text files out with CRLF.
# A shell script with CRLF fails in the container ("bad interpreter" or
# "$'\r': command not found"), and so do hook scripts and Dockerfile RUN
# lines. These patterns keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Written by `sunaba new` only; `sunaba rebuild` leaves this file alone,
# so add your own patterns below.

*.sh          text eol=lf
*.bash        text eol=lf
*.py          text eol=lf
Dockerfile    text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile  text eol=lf
.githooks/*   text eol=lf
